  "title": "Kingfish Enchiladas",
  "description": "Kingfish, a.k.a. King Mackerel, is a strong flavored sport fish which pairs well with the zesty flavor of salsa. Make sure to remove all of the dark meat from the fish when you clean it.",
  "authors": [
